      "content": "growth and redemption feel like jokes. i look in the mirror and i dont see someone who can change, i just see someone who was a coward when it mattered. it doesnt feel like a \"burden\" i can just heal from. it feels like i'm just occupying space that someone better should be in. i don't think i belong here anymore.",
